OL,3,GNEWSAVintage crackers have a new home
OL,4,Aafter auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA box of 12 unopened Christmas crackers
OL,7,Fbelieved to be about 100 years old has
OL,8,Ffetched #72 at auction.
OL,10,FIt had been found in a wardrobe at John
OL,11,FGoddard's house in Gainsborough,
OL,12,FLincolnshire.
OL,14,FHis daughters, Nicky Goddard and Karen
OL,15,FGrundy, think the crackers were given
OL,16,Fto their grandparents in the 1920s or
OL,17,F1930s by friends in Mablethorpe before
OL,18,Fbeing passed down to their parents as a
OL,19,Fwedding gift.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
