OL,3,GNEWSAVintage crackers have a new home
OL,4,Aafter auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter the auction, Nicky said: "It was
OL,7,Fnever [about] how much they were worth.
OL,8,FThe fact they were part of our
OL,9,Fwonderful family [meant that to us]
OL,10,Fthey were priceless."
